 + 504.2 + 26460 - 1196.09 = 265000 + 504.2 = 265504.2; +26460 = 291964.2; -1196.09 = 290768.11 Pa\n\nFrom 2 to 3:\nv2 = 0.836820, v3 = 2.272727\nv2^2 = 0.7003, v3^2 = 5.1653, difference = -4.4650, times 500 = -2232.5 Pa\nρg(z2 - z3) = 9800 * (0.5 - (-0.7)) = 9800 * 1.2 = 11760 Pa\nLoss: K23 * (1/2)ρ v2^2 = 1.2 * 500 * 0.7003 = 1.2 * 350.15 = 420.18 Pa\np3 = p2 + (-2232.5) + 11760 - 420.18 = 290768.11 - 2232.5 = 288535.61; +11760 = 300295.61; -420.18 = 299875.43 Pa\n\nFrom 3 to 4:\nv3 = 2.272727, v4 = 0.952381\nv3^2 = 5.1653, v4^2 = 0.9070, difference = 4.2583, times 500 = 2129.15 Pa\nρg(z3 - z4) = 9800 * (-0.7 - (-6.4)) = 9800 * 5.7 = 55860 Pa\nLoss: K34 * (1/2)ρ v3^2 = 1.1 * 500 * 5.1653 = 1.1 * 2582.65 = 2840.915 Pa\np4 = 299875.43 + 2129.15 + 55860 - 2840.915 = 299875.43 + 2129.15 = 302004.58; +55860 = 357864.58; -2840.915 = 355023.665 Pa\n\nFrom 4 to 5:\nv4 = 0.952381, v5 = 0.729927\nv4^2 = 0.9070, v5^2 = 0.5328, difference = 0.3742, times 500 = 187.1 Pa\nρg(z4 - z5) = 9800 * (-6.4 - 1.6) = 9800 * (-8.0) = -78400 Pa\nLoss: K45 * (1/2)ρ v4^2 = 0.3 * 500 * 0.9070 = 0.3 * 453.5 = 136.05 Pa\np5 = 355023.665 + 187.1 - 78400 - 136.05 = 355023.665 + 187.1 = 355210.765; -78400 = 276810.765; -136.05 = 276674.715 Pa\n\nFrom 5 to 6:\nv5 = 0.729927, v6 = 0.819672\nv5^2 = 0.5328, v6^2 = 0.6719, difference = -0.1391, times 500 = -69.55 Pa\nρg(z5 - z6) = 9800 * (1.6 - (-4.7)) = 9800 * 6.3 = 61740 Pa\nLoss: K56 * (1/2)ρ v5^2 = 0.2 * 500 * 0.5328 = 0.2 * 266.4 = 53.28 Pa\np6 = 276674.715 + (-69.55) + 61740 - 53.28 = 276674.715 - 69.55 = 276605.165; +61740 = 338345.165; -53.28 = 338291.885 Pa\n\nSo p6 ≈ 338292 Pa = 338.292 kPa.\n\nNow we need 4 significant figures. The answer is to be given in kPa. So 338.3 kPa? But careful: 338292 Pa = 338.292 kPa. To 4 sig figs, that is 338.3 kPa (since the fourth digit is after decimal? Actually 338.292 has 6 sig figs. To 4 sig figs, we take the first four digits: 338.3 (since the fourth digit is the 3 after decimal? Let's see: 338.3 has four